"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section explores how to use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to list programs "
"available in Qiskit Serverless, pass inputs into these programs, run them "
"remotely, check their status, and retrieve results and logs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinutuklas ng seksyong ito kung paano gamitin ang `qiskit-ibm-catalog` para "
"mag-lista ng mga programang available sa Qiskit Serverless, magpasa ng mga "
"input sa mga programang ito, patakbuhin ang mga ito nang remote, suriin ang "
"kanilang status, at kunin ang mga resulta at logs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure you have followed the workflow in [Write your first Qiskit "
"Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) before you begin.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siguruhing sinunod mo ang workflow sa [Sumulat ng iyong unang Qiskit "
"Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) bago magsimula.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "List programs available {#list-programs-available}"
msgstr "Mag-lista ng mga available na programa {#list-programs-available}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use `QiskitServerless.list()` to fetch a list of the available "
"programs to run with Qiskit Serverless. This includes the previously "
"uploaded [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-"
"program).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang `QiskitServerless.list()` para makuha ang listahan "
"ng mga available na programa na maaaring patakbuhin gamit ang Qiskit "
"Serverless. Kasama dito ang dating na-upload na "
"[`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-program).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run an uploaded program and pass inputs {#run-an-uploaded-program-and-pass-"
"inputs}"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang na-upload na programa at magpasa ng mga input {#run-an-"
"uploaded-program-and-pass-inputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, set up your inputs. Your program has three inputs: `circuits`, "
"`backend`, and `optimization_level`. You can use `random_circuit` to create "
"30 random circuits:\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, i-set up ang iyong mga input. Ang iyong programa ay may tatlong input: "
"`circuits`, `backend`, at `optimization_level`. Maaari mong gamitin ang "
"`random_circuit` para lumikha ng 30 random na circuits:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-"
"first-workload/extracted-"
"outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output ng nakaraang code cell](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-first-"
"workload/extracted-outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, use `QiskitRuntimeService` and `least_busy` to select a `backend`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, gamitin ang `QiskitRuntimeService` at `least_busy` para pumili ng "
"`backend`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set your optimization level:\n"
msgstr "Itakda ang iyong optimization level:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Select your program with `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Piliin ang iyong programa gamit ang `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, pass your inputs and run it in a pythonic fashion as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, ipasa ang iyong mga input at patakbuhin ito sa paraang pythonic "
"tulad ng sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Suriin ang status ng job {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With your Qiskit Serverless `job_id`, you can check the status of running "
"jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa pamamagitan ng iyong Qiskit Serverless `job_id`, maaari mong suriin ang "
"status ng mga tumatakbong jobs. Kasama dito ang mga sumusunod na status:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Serverless queue. The "
"queue priority is currently based on how much you've used Qiskit "
"Serverless\n"
msgstr ""
"**`QUEUED`**: Ang remote na programa ay nasa Qiskit Serverless queue. Ang "
"priority ng queue ay kasalukuyang batay sa gaano karami ang iyong paggamit "
"ng Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up"
" the remote environment and installing dependencies\n"
msgstr ""
"**`INITIALIZING`**: Nagsisimula na ang remote na programa; kasama dito ang "
"pag-set up ng remote na environment at pag-install ng mga dependency\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. At this stage, if you have `print()` "
"outputs in your program, you can retrieve logs using `job.logs()`\n"
msgstr ""
"**`RUNNING`**: Tumatakbo na ang programa. Sa yugtong ito, kung mayroon kang "
"mga `print()` na output sa iyong programa, maaari kang kumuha ng mga logs "
"gamit ang `job.logs()`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve data stored in "
"`save_result()` with `job.results()`\n"
msgstr ""
"**`DONE`**: Tapos na ang programa, at maaari mong makuha ang data na naka-"
"store sa `save_result()` gamit ang `job.results()`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also set more detailed job statuses in [Manage Qiskit Serverless "
"compute and data resources](/guides/serverless-manage-resources).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari ka ring magtakda ng mas detalyadong mga job status sa [Pamahalaan ang"
" Qiskit Serverless compute at data resources](/guides/serverless-manage-"
"resources).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Sa kasalukuyan, ang IBM Quantum workloads table ay nagpapakita lamang ng mga Qiskit Runtime workload. Gamitin ang `job.status()` para makita ang kasalukuyang status ng iyong Qiskit Serverless workload.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You've successfully run your first Qiskit Serverless program!\n"
msgstr "Matagumpay mong napatakbo ang iyong unang Qiskit Serverless program!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve logs and results {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"
msgstr "Kunin ang mga logs at resulta {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As mentioned before, once a program is `RUNNING`, you can use `job.logs()` "
"to fetch logs created from `print()` outputs:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tulad ng nabanggit kanina, kapag `RUNNING` na ang isang programa, maaari "
"mong gamitin ang `job.logs()` para kunin ang mga logs na nagmula sa mga "
"`print()` na output:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "At any time, you can also cancel a job:\n"
msgstr "Anumang oras, maaari ka ring mag-cancel ng job:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result "
"stored in `save_result()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag `DONE` na ang isang programa, maaari mong gamitin ang `job.results()` "
"para kunin ang resulta na naka-store sa `save_result()`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List jobs previously run with Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-"
"with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""
"Mag-lista ng mga jobs na dating pinatakbo gamit ang Qiskit Serverless "
"{#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Serverless:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang `jobs()` para mag-lista ng lahat ng jobs na "
"isinumite sa Qiskit Serverless:\n"

